{% layout none %}
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta http-equiv="Content-Security-Policy" content="default-src 'none'; script-src https:{{ 'atelier-station.js' | asset_url | split: '?' | first }} https:{{ 'atelier-station-core.js' | asset_url | split: '?' | first }}; style-src https:{{ 'atelier-station.css' | asset_url | split: '?' | first }}; font-src https:{{ 'brown-carolina-sans.woff2' | asset_url | split: '?' | first }}; connect-src https://gefdlubvqymyxrguhtnc.supabase.co; img-src blob: data: https://gefdlubvqymyxrguhtnc.supabase.co; media-src blob:; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; object-src 'none'; frame-src 'none'"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer"><title>Atelier Elunora · Photo Station</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ 'atelier-station.css' | asset_url }}"></head>
<body><main id="station"><header><p class="eyebrow">ATELIER ELUNORA</p><h1 id="title">Photo station</h1><p id="event-name">Connecting to your event…</p></header><p id="demo-label" hidden>DEMO ONLY · Photos are not uploaded or saved.</p><p id="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
<section id="capture" hidden><div class="camera"><video id="camera" autoplay muted playsinline></video><img id="review" alt="Review your photo" width="1200" height="900" hidden></div><p>Keep faces near the center for your square magnet.</p><div class="actions"><button id="start">Enable camera</button><button id="switch" hidden>Switch camera</button><button id="take" hidden>Take photo</button><button id="retake" hidden>Retake</button><button id="accept" hidden>Use this photo</button></div><p class="small">Choosing “Use this photo” sends it to this event’s private gallery and the attendant’s print queue. Only submit photos you have permission to share.</p></section>
<section id="printing" hidden><section id="letter-queue"><h2>Automatic letter sheets</h2><p>Six different photos, one magnet each, on 8.5 × 11 inch paper. Uses the event’s saved wrap template and each photo’s saved crop. Multiple-copy jobs stay in the individual queue.</p><p class="small">Cut size must be 3.6 inches or smaller. A 3.75-inch cut cannot fit six on Letter. At 3.6 inches only 0.1 inch remains above and below the sheet; test your printer and cutter first. Print at 100%, with headers and footers off. Your browser may require you to approve its print dialog.</p><div class="actions"><button id="letter-toggle">Start automatic six-photo sheets</button><button id="letter-partial">Print remaining photos</button></div><p id="letter-status" role="status">Automatic sheets paused.</p><div id="letter-active" hidden><button id="letter-print">Prepare / print this sheet</button><button id="letter-confirm">Confirm sheet physically printed</button><button id="letter-release">Return sheet to pending</button></div></section><p>New photos appear automatically every 5 seconds. Open a job to review its crop and quantity.</p><label>Queue status <select id="queue-filter"><option value="pending">Pending</option><option value="printing">Printing / needs confirmation</option><option value="held">Held</option></select></label><button id="refresh">Refresh queue</button><div class="workspace"><div id="jobs" aria-label="Print queue"></div><section id="editor" hidden><h2 id="job-title">Review photo</h2><button id="editor-close">Close photo editor</button><canvas id="crop" width="750" height="750" aria-label="Square crop preview"></canvas><label>Zoom <output id="zoom-value">1.00×</output><input id="zoom" type="range" min="1" max="3" step="0.01" value="1"></label><button id="reset-crop">Reset crop</button><label>Horizontal crop <input id="x" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50"></label><label>Vertical crop <input id="y" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50"></label><label>Magnet quantity <input id="quantity" type="number" min="1" max="12" value="1"></label><label>Cut size, inches <input id="cut" type="number" min="2.5" max="3.75" step="0.01" value="2.5"></label><details id="template-editor" open><summary>Magnet wrap template</summary><label><input id="template-enabled" type="checkbox"> Print customized wrap around the 2.5-inch photo</label><p class="small">Lines are positioned for the folded back edges. The dashed square marks the front photo and is never printed. Calibrate with a pressed sample.</p><div class="wrap-colors"><label>Wrap background color <input id="template-background" type="color" value="#ebe5d9"></label><label>Background hex <input id="template-background-hex" type="text" maxlength="7" value="#EBE5D9" placeholder="#EBE5D9"></label><label>Text color <input id="template-color" type="color" value="#252b1d"></label></div><p class="small">This color covers all four folded wrap edges. Choose Reload event template to bring in a color you just saved in the owner app. Changes here apply to this photo.</p><div id="template-sides"></div><label>Text size, points <input id="template-font" type="number" min="5" max="12" step="0.5" value="7"></label><label>Text distance from image edge, inches <input id="template-inset" type="number" min="0" max="0.625" step="0.001" value="0.255"></label><p class="small">Measured from the photo edge to the center of the text. Increase to move lettering outward into the wrap; decrease to move it toward the photo. Text must fit between the fold and cut edges.</p><button id="template-reset">Reload event template</button><p id="template-status" role="status"></p><canvas id="template-preview" width="975" height="975" aria-label="Magnet wrap preview with nonprinting front fold guide"></canvas></details><p class="small">Landscape 6 × 4 inch sheets at 300 pixels per inch. A 3.25-inch wrap prints one magnet per sheet. Print at 100% / actual size, with headers and footers off. Disable borderless enlargement and verify with a ruler.</p><div class="actions"><button id="prepare">Prepare sheets</button><button id="hold">Hold photo</button><button id="printed" hidden>Confirm physically printed</button><button id="retry" hidden>Return to pending</button></div><p id="print-note"></p></section></div><section id="sheet-controls" hidden><h2>Prepared print sheets</h2><p>Inspect the sheets below, then open the print dialog. Confirm physically printed only after checking the actual output.</p><button id="print">Open print dialog</button><div id="downloads"></div></section></section>
<footer><button id="close">Close this station on this device</button><p class="small">Keep this device awake and online. Ask the attendant if you need help.</p></footer></main><div id="sheets"></div>
<script type="module" src="{{ 'atelier-station.js' | asset_url }}"></script></body></html>
